# Local virtualenv

Always run Python and pip through `.venv` in the repo root. Do not use system `python3` or `pip`.

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
.venv/bin/python utg900e_cli.py dump
.venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt

# ❌ BAD
python3 utg900e_cli.py dump
pip install -r requirements.txt
```
